13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# B2B vs B2C Email Marketing: 7 Key Differences You Need to Know"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Excerpt:"}]," B2B and B2C email marketing require fundamentally different approaches. Compare strategies for segmentation, content, timing, and automation--with real data, clear examples, and actionable advice you can implement *today*."]}],["$","hr","4",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Email remains one of the highest-ROI marketing channels--generating ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"$$36 for every $1 spent"}],", according to the Data & Marketing Association (DMA). But here's the catch: that ROI isn't universal. What works for a DTC skincare brand will likely flop for an enterprise SaaS provider. Why? Because ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"B2B and B2C audiences operate in entirely different decision ecosystems"}],"."]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Let's cut through the noise. Below are ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"7 concrete, research-backed differences"}]," between B2B and B2C email marketing--with tactical takeaways you can apply immediately."]}],["$","hr","10",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","12",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"1. Audience Size & List Growth Velocity"}],["$","p","13",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"B2B"}],": Small, high-intent lists. Average B2B list size is ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"~12,000 contacts"}],", with growth rates of just ",["$","strong","5",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"5-8% per quarter"}]," (HubSpot, 2023 State of Marketing Report)."]}],["$","p","14",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"B2C"}],": Large, broad lists. Top e-commerce brands average ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":">500,000 subscribers"}],", growing at ",["$","strong","5",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"15-25% quarterly"}]," (Klaviyo Benchmark Report, 2024)."]}],["$","p","16",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ *Actionable Tip*:"]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"B2B"}],": Prioritize *quality over quantity*. Use gated content (e.g., \"State of AI in Finance\" report) + LinkedIn lead gen forms to capture verified job titles and company size."]}],["$","p","18",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"B2C"}],": Leverage pop-ups with *value-driven incentives* (e.g., \"Get 15% off your first order\") -- but A/B test exit-intent vs. scroll-triggered timing. Brands using scroll-triggered pop-ups see ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"2.3× higher opt-in rates"}],", per OptinMonster."]}],["$","hr","20",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","22",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"2. Segmentation Depth"}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22",